            "value": "Gray Glass uses a continuous gray surface with white text. Glass Cards groups the display policies in a single rounded tile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灰幕玻璃以整块中性灰衬托白字。模块玻璃将四个内屏策略放在同一张圆角灰玻璃卡片中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
