            "value": "Only one policy can be enabled. Follow System cannot be turned off while selected. Turning a running policy off returns to Follow System."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次只启用一种策略。「跟随系统」选中时无法关闭；关闭运行策略后恢复跟随系统。"
